        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Any batches of product candidates for commercialization will need to be manufactured in facilities, and by processes, that comply with the requirements of the FDA, the EMA, and the regulatory agencies of other jurisdictions in which we are seeking approval.",
