        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-115226-1b51f4c0bbdbe550",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-115226",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For acumapimod, although we are not aware of any approved therapies for the treatment of AECOPD, there are a wide range of established therapies available for the treatment of COPD as well as a number of product candidates in development.",
        "start_character": 59562,
        "end_character": 59800
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-115226",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-115226-1b51f4c0bbdbe550",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-115226",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For our other current and future product candidates, we intend to take strategic decisions on whether to further develop them, potentially through to approval, directly commercializing globally or in certain territories, or to seek a partner for further development, co-development and/or commercialization.",
        "start_character": 54507,
        "end_character": 54814
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-115226",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-115226-1b51f4c0bbdbe550",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-115226",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In order to commercialize our product candidates, if approved for commercial sale, we must either develop a sales and marketing infrastructure or collaborate with third parties that have sales and marketing experience.",
        "start_character": 53886,
        "end_character": 54104
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-115226",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-115226-1b51f4c0bbdbe550",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-115226",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our breach of any license agreements or failure to obtain a license to proprietary rights that we may require to develop or commercialize our product candidates may have an adverse impact on us.",
        "start_character": 67314,
        "end_character": 67508
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-115226",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-115226-1b51f4c0bbdbe550",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-115226",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our commercial opportunity could be reduced or eliminated if our competitors develop and commercialize product candidates that are safer, more effective, less expensive, convenient or easier to administer or have fewer or less severe side effects than any product candidates that we may develop.",
        "start_character": 62310,
        "end_character": 62605
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-115226",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-115226-1b51f4c0bbdbe550",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-115226",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our competitors may also obtain FDA, EMA, MHRA or other regulatory approval for their product candidates more rapidly than we may obtain approval for our own product candidates, which could result in our competitors establishing a strong market position before we are able to enter the market.",
        "start_character": 62606,
        "end_character": 62899
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-115226",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-115226-1b51f4c0bbdbe550",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-115226",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Risk Factors—Risks Related to Commercialization—We operate in a highly competitive and rapidly changing industry, which may result in others acquiring, developing, or commercializing competing product candidates before or more successfully than we or our partners do.”",
        "start_character": 63193,
        "end_character": 63461
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-115226",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-115226-1b51f4c0bbdbe550",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-115226",
